{"id":"n70503-1-13","stage":1,"title":"어린아이 · 小孩","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70503-1-13-1","ko":"나 저거 안 사주면 집에 안 갈 거야.","zh":"如果你不给我买那个，我就不回家。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"저거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"저거：那个","readings":[{"term":"저거","audio":"/audio/d3476ad2b3a3fd79be3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29739","senseId":"1","lemma":"저거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저거","audio":"/audio/d3476ad2b3a3fd79be3b.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"사주면","meaning":"请客，付账，买单；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"사다：请客，付账，买单；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"5","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사주면","audio":"/audio/6a52fb60f28140924092.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"d3476ad2b3a3fd79","term":"저거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/d3476ad2b3a3fd79be3b.mp3","entryId":"29739","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저거"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"请客，付账，买单","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"支付与他人一起吃饭的费用。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3909d86a6b81bd62d1c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70503-1-13-2","ko":"나이가 몇인데 어린아이처럼 떼를 쓰니?","zh":"都多大了还像小孩子一样耍性子？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나이가","audio":"/audio/61d19a9f3b9c5119f3e9.mp3"}},{"text":"몇인데","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇인데","audio":"/audio/12f9739460552c7f1bb7.mp3"}},{"text":"어린아이처럼","meaning":"小孩","explanation":"어린아이：小孩；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"어린아이","audio":"/audio/883924e23c907a13d4ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70503","senseId":"1","lemma":"어린아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린아이처럼","audio":"/audio/bd31b3282b631158edce.mp3"}},{"text":"떼를","meaning":"耍赖，赖皮，纠缠","explanation":"떼：耍赖，赖皮，纠缠；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"떼","audio":"/audio/f447b643e59d2d414dc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54096","senseId":"1","lemma":"떼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떼를","audio":"/audio/fbd80f36617b29190324.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰니?","meaning":"耍赖","explanation":"쓰다：耍赖；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"7","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading